Engineering is right that zero public outage is non-negotiable, so their $3,500 floor is locked. Marketing gets their minimum $4,500 for the ad campaign to ensure top-of-funnel leads. Sales must accept $2,000 to operate lean, relying on warm inbound leads from Marketing rather than paid outreach. This hits our 90-day revenue and stability goals.
  @Marketing: Deliver enough qualified recruiter leads to hit our 90-day revenue targets.
  @Engineering: Guarantee zero public outages and robust load testing under peak AI interview traffic.
  @Sales: Close inbound leads efficiently using lean outreach and existing pipeline tools.
